PentaX adds generation-bound service admission, opaque owner/executor contexts,
checked guest stack/source selection, atomic ABI publication, per-thread roots,
bounded migration policy and original fixtures. Full CPU/control-state transport
and lazy bounded contextless stacks are PentaX policies, not claims that the
reference assembly saves floating/vector state or implements these safety checks.
